        {
          "no": 3,
          "en": "DATA",
          "title": "你需要准备什么",
          "html": "<p style=\"margin-bottom:14px\">曲线从来不难拿，难的是<b>标签</b>和<b>对齐依据</b>。立项前先确认有没有一口全区稳定的标志层 —— 没有它，标准化就无从谈起。</p><div class=\"checklist\"><div class=\"cl-head\"><span>数据准备清单 · 5 项</span><span class=\"cl-prog\"><span id=\"cl-txt\">0 / 5</span><span class=\"cl-bar\"><i id=\"cl-fill\"></i></span></span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"0\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5\"/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\">常规测井曲线</span><span class=\"cl-s\">GR / DEN / CNL / AC / RT，0.125 m 采样</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">至少两条，缺一不可</span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"1\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5\"/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\">岩性标签</span><span class=\"cl-s\">取心段岩心描述、岩屑录井、或成熟井解释成果</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">500—3000 个层点</span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"2\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5\"/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\">标志层与标准化依据</span><span class=\"cl-s\">全区稳定分布的泥岩段或灰岩标志层</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">跨井对齐的基准</span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"3\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5\"/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\">区域地层表</span><span class=\"cl-s\">本区可能出现的岩性组合</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">限定候选类别，别让模型乱猜</span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"4\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5\"/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\">井径与泥浆记录</span><span class=\"cl-s\">判断密度曲线是否失真</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">扩径段要剔除</span></div></div><p style=\"margin-top:18px\"><span class=\"kicker plain\" style=\"color:var(--ink-4)\">可参考的公开数据集</span></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/bolgebrygg/Force-2020-Machine-Learning-competition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FORCE 2020 岩性预测竞赛：多井曲线与岩性标签 ↗</a></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/seg/2016-ml-contest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">SEG 2016 相分类竞赛：参考盲井评估，数据另有使用限制 ↗</a></p><p class=\"small muted\">当前演示未使用上述数据。接入真实数据前须核查分发许可、类别定义及完整测试井划分。</p>"
        },
        {
          "no": 4,
          "en": "DIFFICULTY",
          "title": "技术难度与参考方向",
          "html": "<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:2px\"><span class=\"dtag\" data-d=\"中\">难度 中</span><span class=\"small muted\">分类算法本身很成熟；难点全在\"井与井之间对不齐\"。</span></div><div class=\"meter\"><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"\"></i></div><p>重点核查三个条件：<b>井间刻度差</b>是否改变近邻，<b>单曲线重叠</b>是否需要补充特征，以及<b>薄互层</b>是否被曲线分辨率限制。前两项可在当前合成演示中控制；真实薄层响应还需要相应数据验证。</p><p>建议的验证顺序：先画交会图确认<b>类别在二维上是否可分</b>；再做标准化并<b>按井划分</b>验证；最后才比模型。反过来做（先选模型再调参）是这条案例里最常见的失败路径。</p><p style=\"margin-top:18px\"><span class=\"kicker plain\" style=\"color:var(--ink-4)\">可借鉴的通用技术</span></p><div class=\"refs\"><a class=\"ref\" href=\"#/method/ts\">K 近邻与随机森林<span class=\"ar\">↗</span></a><a class=\"ref\" href=\"#/method/ts\">按组划分验证<span class=\"ar\">↗</span></a><a class=\"ref\" href=\"#/method/ts\">特征标准化<span class=\"ar\">↗</span></a><a class=\"ref\" href=\"#/method/ts\">类别不均衡处理<span class=\"ar\">↗</span></a></div><p style=\"margin-top:18px\" class=\"small muted\">交叉环节：<a href=\"#/stage/welllog\" style=\"color:var(--jade-d);font-weight:600\">测井</a> · <a href=\"#/stage/mudlog\" style=\"color:var(--jade-d);font-weight:600\">录井</a> · <a href=\"#/stage/reservoir\" style=\"color:var(--jade-d);font-weight:600\">油藏</a></p>"
        }
